OL,3,GNEWSASecond night of drone disruption
OL,4,Aat Jersey Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates of Jersey Police are
OL,7,Finvestigating the incidents and has
OL,8,Fappealed to anyone with information
OL,9,Fabout who is responsible to come
OL,10,Fforward.
OL,12,FThe Government of Jersey said it was
OL,13,Fworking on arrangements to reduce the
OL,14,Frisk of further disruption and minimise
OL,15,Fthe impact on passengers in the event
OL,16,Fof further drone activity on Sunday
OL,17,Fevening.
